      "system": "GRIB2",
      "transformations": [
        "identification: the reference time is Section 1 octets 13-19 (year, month, day, hour, minute, second) in UTC; it is the contract's reference_time, SourceRef.observed_at and the Event's observed_at, which for every class this module emits is the reference time",
        "fields[*].product: Template 4.0's validity is the instant reference time + forecast time in its Table 4.4 unit; Template 4.8's is the overall interval from that instant (Note 2) to octets 35-41's end, held to equal its start plus the one time range's length",
        "fields[*].product.parameters.surface1_*: the level's value is the scaled value x 10^-(scale factor), stated only where Table 4.5 gives the surface a unit",
        "fields[*].grid: the footprint is the outline of the Lambert conformal grid points, each converted to latitude and longitude by the spherical inverse (the earth's radius from Table 3.2 or the template), densified to at most 16 segments an edge and rounded to 10^-6 degree; the sphere's coordinates are stated as WGS84 ones, without a datum shift",
        "derived: the values stay in the message, by reference; the contract's summary decodes every value as Y = (R + X x 2^E) / 10^D, counts the points the bitmap leaves out, the values Table 5.5 marks missing and the sentinels a parameter's table names, and states the minimum and maximum of the rest"
      ]
    },
